  "style": [
    "Sentence case for every label, heading and menu item. Product and proper names keep their capitals.",
    "A feature has one name. The settings entry, the page title and the plugin list use the title the plugin policy gives it (policies/policies.json).",
    "A label is a short noun phrase with no full stop. A description is a full sentence with a full stop.",
    "No emoji, no middle dot, no dash that joins a name to a gloss. Say Arc Harness, never deployment, host or generation.",
    "Same word for the same thing: session, plugin, skill, model."
